# PSI “Improve image delivery” on homepage (learned 2026-09-16)

Owner pasted PageSpeed Mobile insight: Supabase ~686 KiB with ~503 KiB claimed savings + 1st-party `/images/logo.png` ~89 KiB.

## Root cause (not “wrong logo upload”)

PSI compares **file pixel size / bytes** vs **CSS displayed size**. We serve **full CMS WebP URLs** (Supabase pass-through). There is **no** runtime resize for Supabase (`optimizeStorefrontImageUrl` only mutates **Unsplash** `w`/`q`). Category cards display ~400px tall; files are often ~800–1000px → “larger than needed.”

## Line-item map (live classes)

| PSI target | Typical issue | Why in SELPIC |
|------------|---------------|---------------|
| `category-bg/*.webp` (~90–149 KiB, e.g. 973×1024 shown at ~400×400) | Oversized for display | `CategoryCoverImage` uses CMS URL as-is (`maxWidth: 720` only helps Unsplash). Cards are ~400px; download is full asset. |
| `hero-banner/…________1.webp` (~133 KiB) + other hero WebP | “Increase compression” | Poster/fallback already WebP; PSI wants higher lossy compress or smaller encode. Not a wrong URL. |
| `header-logo/…a2wiua96u-logo.webp` (~16.5 KiB, 584×172 → ~136×40) | Oversized for display | **Correct new CMS logo** is loading. Header CSS is `h-10` (~40px). File is brand-resolution; tiny display → claimed ~15 KiB save. |
| `/images/logo.png` (~89 KiB, 584×172 → ~95×28) | Old PNG + oversized + not WebP | **Favicon / layout icons / OG / HeaderLogo fallback** — **not** Admin Logo Image Management. Hardcoded `app/layout.tsx` + favicon rewrite. Confirms old static still requested alongside new header WebP. |

## What this does **not** mean

- Header brand mark failed to update — CMS WebP **is** in the list (`header-logo/…logo.webp`).
- Need Hero `next/image` rewrite for this insight alone — optional later; primary LCP lever remains **hero MP4**.
- Category “dark” overlay causes byte waste — overlay is CSS, not download size.

## Levers (when owner asks to fix)

1. **Admin:** re-upload category/hero images closer to display size (e.g. long edge ~800–1080, tighter WebP).
2. **Code (optional):** `srcset`/`sizes` or Next Image / transform CDN for Supabase; or upload-time `encodeStorefrontWebp` for CMS (not only product AI).
3. **Static logo:** replace `public/images/logo.png` (+ apple-touch) with small WebP/PNG and point `layout.tsx` icons there to clear the 89 KiB 1st-party hit.

## Do not

- Re-upload header logo repeatedly expecting `/images/logo.png` to disappear — that path is separate.
- Chase every KiB of header-logo 584→136 display mismatch before hero MP4 / category oversized BGs.
